        <mxCell id="notes" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;*1 Principle: write local, place cross-cloud dependency on the read side&lt;br&gt;A write path that crosses clouds couples ingest to the remote API. The read side is cacheable and retriable.&lt;br&gt;*2 Network reachability and ONTAP mobility are different questions&lt;br&gt;FlexCache with a non-AWS ONTAP service as Origin is unverified in this repository." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;strokeColor=#232F3E;fillColor=none;fontColor=#232F3E;fontSize=16;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
